      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "## MAIN multi-app board (Classic — same tile shape as your Request count example)\n\n**All (default):** tiles use empty `filterBy` / empty `tileFilter` → every service/host (this JSON as imported).\n\n**Select EIP (same board, do not clone):** open **Dashboard filter** → filter by tag `app:eip` (or Management Zone for EIP). All DATA_EXPLORER + Problems tiles narrow together → multi EIP servers + request/errors.\n\n**Also OK:** keep `All` with no dashboard filter; for a locked EIP view, set each tile `filterBy` criteria to tag `app:eip` (see markdown at bottom).\n\nTag once: hosts + services `app:eip` / `app:api` / `app:payment`."
    },
